Yes?

cue0100516
00:34:08.159 --> 00:34:10.159
Kevodih umerim noshi.

cue0100517
00:34:10.159 --> 00:34:12.159
Now,

cue0100518
00:34:12.159 --> 00:34:14.159
you are my honor.

cue0100519
00:34:14.159 --> 00:34:16.159
In other words, my honor

cue0100520
00:34:16.159 --> 00:34:18.159
is in your hand.

cue0100521
00:34:18.159 --> 00:34:20.159
Umerim noshi.

cue0100522
00:34:20.159 --> 00:34:22.159
My head is down.

cue0100523
00:34:22.159 --> 00:34:24.159
It's sad.

cue0100524
00:34:24.159 --> 00:34:26.159
It's broken.

cue0100525
00:34:26.159 --> 00:34:28.159
It's looking down.

cue0100526
00:34:28.159 --> 00:34:30.159
Umerim noshi.

cue0100527
00:34:30.159 --> 00:34:32.159
You are going to lift my head.

cue0100528
00:34:32.159 --> 00:34:34.159
Kevodih umerim noshi.

cue0100529
00:34:34.159 --> 00:34:36.159
You are going to lift my head.

cue0100530
00:34:36.159 --> 00:34:38.159
Umerim noshi.

cue0100531
00:34:38.159 --> 00:34:40.159
My head is down.

cue0100532
00:34:40.159 --> 00:34:42.159
It's a broken man.

cue0100533
00:34:42.159 --> 00:34:44.159
Yes?

cue0100534
00:34:44.159 --> 00:34:46.159
Umerim noshi.

cue0100535
00:34:46.159 --> 00:34:48.159
You are going to lift my head.

cue0100536
00:34:48.159 --> 00:34:50.159
Magen baadi.

cue0100537
00:34:50.159 --> 00:34:52.159
You know what the word magen means.

cue0100538
00:34:52.159 --> 00:34:54.159
Shield. I don't want to destroy

cue0100539
00:34:54.159 --> 00:34:56.159
the enemy. I want you just to protect me

cue0100540
00:34:56.159 --> 00:34:58.159
from the attacks of the enemy.

cue0100541
00:34:58.159 --> 00:35:00.159
Magen baadi.

cue0100542
00:35:00.159 --> 00:35:02.159
Yes?

cue0100543
00:35:02.159 --> 00:35:04.159
Kevodih, you are my honor.

cue0100544
00:35:04.159 --> 00:35:06.159
Yes?

cue0100545
00:35:06.159 --> 00:35:08.159
My honor is in your hand.

cue0100546
00:35:08.159 --> 00:35:10.159
Umerim noshi.

cue0100547
00:35:10.159 --> 00:35:12.159
And the one who's going to raise my head.

cue0100548
00:35:12.159 --> 00:35:14.159
I think it's

cue0100549
00:35:14.159 --> 00:35:16.159
very poetic.

cue0100550
00:35:16.159 --> 00:35:18.159
A lot of feeling.

cue0100551
00:35:18.159 --> 00:35:20.159
And it's very accurate also.

cue0100552
00:35:20.159 --> 00:35:22.159
Kevod.

cue0100553
00:35:22.159 --> 00:35:24.159
Koli elabonae ikram.

cue0100554
00:35:24.159 --> 00:35:26.159
Re'aneni mehal.

cue0100555
00:35:26.159 --> 00:35:28.159
Ocho sebe.

cue0100556
00:35:28.159 --> 00:35:30.159
I'm

cue0100557
00:35:30.159 --> 00:35:32.159
going to raise my voice.

cue0100558
00:35:32.159 --> 00:35:34.159
Koli elabonae

cue0100559
00:35:34.159 --> 00:35:36.159
ikram.

cue0100560
00:35:36.159 --> 00:35:38.159
I'm not going to

cue0100561
00:35:38.159 --> 00:35:40.159
ask

cue0100562
00:35:40.159 --> 00:35:42.159
help from anyone else.

cue0100563
00:35:42.159 --> 00:35:44.159
Ani. Yes?

cue0100564
00:35:44.159 --> 00:35:46.159
Koli elabonae ikram.

cue0100565
00:35:46.159 --> 00:35:48.159
I am going to call upon God.

cue0100566
00:35:48.159 --> 00:35:50.159
Yes?

cue0100567
00:35:50.159 --> 00:35:52.159
What does he have something

cue0100568
00:35:52.159 --> 00:35:54.159
that God

cue0100569
00:35:54.159 --> 00:35:56.159
zekhut?

cue0100570
00:35:56.159 --> 00:35:58.159
What is the zekhut that

cue0100571
00:35:58.159 --> 00:36:00.159
David of Benek has that gives him

cue0100572
00:36:00.159 --> 00:36:02.159
confidence that God is going to

cue0100573
00:36:02.159 --> 00:36:04.159
answer?

cue0100574
00:36:04.159 --> 00:36:06.159
Because he is the one

cue0100575
00:36:06.159 --> 00:36:08.159
who conquered

cue0100576
00:36:08.159 --> 00:36:10.159
the Mount Zion.

cue0100577
00:36:10.159 --> 00:36:12.159
The Alam Uriah was in the hands

cue0100578
00:36:12.159 --> 00:36:14.159
of Goyim.

cue0100579
00:36:14.159 --> 00:36:16.159
He conquered that heart.

cue0100580
00:36:16.159 --> 00:36:18.159
Because that heart was the place

cue0100581
00:36:18.159 --> 00:36:20.159
that mountains was the place

cue0100582
00:36:20.159 --> 00:36:22.159
where Abraham

cue0100583
00:36:22.159 --> 00:36:24.159
offered

cue0100584
00:36:24.159 --> 00:36:26.159
his heart as a sacrifice.

cue0100585
00:36:26.159 --> 00:36:28.159
That was the place where

cue0100586
00:36:28.159 --> 00:36:30.159
Yaʿaqoḇ Aminu

cue0100587
00:36:30.159 --> 00:36:32.159
had a dream

cue0100588
00:36:32.159 --> 00:36:34.159
with the Marachim,

cue0100589
00:36:34.159 --> 00:36:36.159
the angels.

cue0100590
00:36:36.159 --> 00:36:38.159
And King David got

cue0100591
00:36:38.159 --> 00:36:40.159
back that mountain

cue0100592
00:36:40.159 --> 00:36:42.159
and he said

cue0100593
00:36:42.159 --> 00:36:44.159
that that mountain is going to be

cue0100594
00:36:44.159 --> 00:36:46.159
the place of the Bet HaMikdash.

cue0100595
00:36:46.159 --> 00:36:48.159
And therefore

cue0100596
00:36:48.159 --> 00:36:50.159
from that mountain

cue0100597
00:36:50.159 --> 00:36:52.159
God would answer him.

cue0100598
00:36:52.159 --> 00:36:54.159
It's something very profound.

cue0100599
00:36:54.159 --> 00:36:56.159
We always

cue0100600
00:36:56.159 --> 00:36:58.159
think that God is in heaven.

cue0100601
00:36:58.159 --> 00:37:00.159
Of course God is in heaven.

cue0100602
00:37:00.159 --> 00:37:02.159
But we believe

cue0100603
00:37:02.159 --> 00:37:04.159
that the Shekhina,

cue0100604
00:37:04.159 --> 00:37:06.159
the presence of God

cue0100605
00:37:06.159 --> 00:37:08.159
is down on earth

cue0100606
00:37:08.159 --> 00:37:10.159
in a place called

cue0100607
00:37:10.159 --> 00:37:12.159
Yerushalayim.

cue0100608
00:37:12.159 --> 00:37:14.159
And therefore we believe

cue0100609
00:37:14.159 --> 00:37:16.159
that there is a shortcut.

cue0100610
00:37:16.159 --> 00:37:18.159
How could you get from here

cue0100611
00:37:18.159 --> 00:37:20.159
to heaven?

cue0100612
00:37:20.159 --> 00:37:22.159
There is a shortcut.

cue0100613
00:37:22.159 --> 00:37:24.159
The moment you are down by the Bet HaMikdash

cue0100614
00:37:24.159 --> 00:37:26.159
Beze Sha'ar HaShavayim

cue0100615
00:37:26.159 --> 00:37:28.159
through

cue0100616
00:37:28.159 --> 00:37:30.159
this earthly place

cue0100617
00:37:30.159 --> 00:37:32.159
suddenly you enter

cue0100618
00:37:32.159 --> 00:37:34.159
and you are in the gates of heaven.

cue0100619
00:37:34.159 --> 00:37:36.159
So

cue0100620
00:37:36.159 --> 00:37:38.159
do you remember that

cue0100621
00:37:38.159 --> 00:37:40.159
Ya'akov

cue0100622
00:37:40.159 --> 00:37:42.159
saw a ladder going up

cue0100623
00:37:42.159 --> 00:37:44.159
and then he says

cue0100624
00:37:44.159 --> 00:37:46.159
Beze Sha'ar HaShavayim

cue0100625
00:37:46.159 --> 00:37:48.159
Beze Sha'ar HaShavayim

cue0100626
00:37:48.159 --> 00:37:50.159
Sha'ar HaShavayim

cue0100627
00:37:50.159 --> 00:37:52.159
So you enter the Bet HaMikdash

cue0100628
00:37:52.159 --> 00:37:54.159
and you are in heaven.

cue0100629
00:37:54.159 --> 00:37:56.159
And therefore we believe

cue0100630
00:37:56.159 --> 00:37:58.159
that if you pray

cue0100631
00:37:58.159 --> 00:38:00.159
there in the Bet HaMikdash

cue0100632
00:38:00.159 --> 00:38:02.159
that's why it's important for us

cue0100633
00:38:02.159 --> 00:38:04.159
the Bet HaMikdash

cue0100634
00:38:04.159 --> 00:38:06.159
So if you

cue0100635
00:38:06.159 --> 00:38:08.159
pray there

cue0100636
00:38:08.159 --> 00:38:10.159
God will answer you.

cue0100637
00:38:10.159 --> 00:38:12.159
So therefore

cue0100638
00:38:12.159 --> 00:38:14.159
Be'a'anayim Har Kocho

cue0100639
00:38:14.159 --> 00:38:16.159
The Har that is the sanctity of God

cue0100640
00:38:16.159 --> 00:38:18.159
because God is there.

cue0100641
00:38:18.159 --> 00:38:20.159
So he, the Bet HaMikdash in a sense

cue0100642
00:38:20.159 --> 00:38:22.159
is the first person

cue0100643
00:38:22.159 --> 00:38:24.159
who is praying

cue0100644
00:38:24.159 --> 00:38:26.159
towards the Bet HaMikdash.

cue0100645
00:38:26.159 --> 00:38:28.159
And he says

cue0100646
00:38:28.159 --> 00:38:30.159
Well, A'anayim.

cue0100647
00:38:30.159 --> 00:38:32.159
And the word

cue0100648
00:38:32.159 --> 00:38:34.159
A'anayim becomes part of our Salah

cue0100649
00:38:34.159 --> 00:38:36.159
for the Shana

cue0100650
00:38:36.159 --> 00:38:38.159
In Yom Kippur

cue0100651
00:38:38.159 --> 00:38:40.159
That's the A'anayim

cue0100652
00:38:40.159 --> 00:38:42.159
of David Amalek

cue0100653
00:38:42.159 --> 00:38:44.159
So it became like a thing.

cue0100654
00:38:44.159 --> 00:38:46.159
So

cue0100655
00:38:46.159 --> 00:38:48.159
Go ahead.

cue0100656
00:38:48.159 --> 00:38:50.159
Is it fun?

cue0100657
00:38:50.159 --> 00:38:52.159
Tell me a little bit.

cue0100658
00:38:52.159 --> 00:38:54.159
Have you ever read David Amalek?

cue0100659
00:38:54.159 --> 00:38:56.159
The Psalms?

cue0100660
00:38:56.159 --> 00:38:58.159
Any of you?

cue0100661
00:38:58.159 --> 00:39:00.159
Yes?

cue0100662
00:39:02.159 --> 00:39:04.159
Yes.

cue0100663
00:39:04.159 --> 00:39:06.159
He is singing it

cue0100664
00:39:06.159 --> 00:39:08.159
as a prayer

cue0100665
00:39:08.159 --> 00:39:10.159
for himself.

cue0100666
00:39:10.159 --> 00:39:12.159
So was it written as a song?

cue0100667
00:39:12.159 --> 00:39:14.159
It was written as a song. It says Mizmor.

cue0100668
00:39:14.159 --> 00:39:16.159
Mizmor, right.

cue0100669
00:39:16.159 --> 00:39:18.159
When you write a song

cue0100670
00:39:18.159 --> 00:39:20.159
usually you write a song to make a song

cue0100671
00:39:20.159 --> 00:39:22.159
and you have these feelings.

cue0100672
00:39:22.159 --> 00:39:24.159
When you are making a prayer

cue0100673
00:39:24.159 --> 00:39:26.159
you have an urgent need right away

cue0100674
00:39:26.159 --> 00:39:28.159
and you don't bother to make

cue0100675
00:39:28.159 --> 00:39:30.159
Salah or song.

cue0100676
00:39:30.159 --> 00:39:32.159
I don't know the context.

cue0100677
00:39:32.159 --> 00:39:34.159
The context is this.

cue0100678
00:39:34.159 --> 00:39:36.159
This begins as a prayer

cue0100679
00:39:36.159 --> 00:39:38.159
as a private prayer from David Amalek.

cue0100680
00:39:38.159 --> 00:39:40.159
Eventually

cue0100681
00:39:40.159 --> 00:39:42.159
it becomes a song

cue0100682
00:39:42.159 --> 00:39:44.159
because he wrote 150 Psalms

cue0100683
00:39:44.159 --> 00:39:46.159
and this becomes

cue0100684
00:39:46.159 --> 00:39:48.159
the Psalms

cue0100685
00:39:48.159 --> 00:39:50.159
sung by David Amalek

cue0100686
00:39:50.159 --> 00:39:52.159
in the Bet hammiqdash.

cue0100687
00:39:52.159 --> 00:39:54.159
And that's why I say this is the mindset of the Jews.

cue0100688
00:39:54.159 --> 00:39:56.159
Because if you hear something in the Bet hammiqdash

cue0100689
00:39:56.159 --> 00:39:58.159
you are not going to forget it very soon.

cue0100690
00:39:58.159 --> 00:40:00.159
This is the official creed

cue0100691
00:40:00.159 --> 00:40:02.159
the official mind of the Jewish people.

cue0100692
00:40:02.159 --> 00:40:04.159
We believe

cue0100693
00:40:04.159 --> 00:40:06.159
actually

cue0100694
00:40:06.159 --> 00:40:08.159
what King David believed.

cue0100695
00:40:08.159 --> 00:40:10.159
Mizmor 1, 2, 3 to the 150.

cue0100696
00:40:10.159 --> 00:40:12.159
We believe in it.

cue0100697
00:40:12.159 --> 00:40:14.159
And that is the great Zechut of David Amalek.

cue0100698
00:40:14.159 --> 00:40:16.159
To have these songs

cue0100699
00:40:16.159 --> 00:40:18.159
are

cue0100700
00:40:18.159 --> 00:40:20.159
sung in the Bet hammiqdash

cue0100701
00:40:20.159 --> 00:40:22.159
and they had music.

cue0100702
00:40:22.159 --> 00:40:24.159
Personal but they became

cue0100703
00:40:24.159 --> 00:40:26.159
national.

cue0100704
00:40:26.159 --> 00:40:28.159
This is what makes it a great poem.

cue0100705
00:40:28.159 --> 00:40:30.159
It is a poem that

cue0100706
00:40:30.159 --> 00:40:32.159
you write it personally and

cue0100707
00:40:32.159 --> 00:40:34.159
suddenly you realize

cue0100708
00:40:34.159 --> 00:40:36.159
that this is a problem that we all

cue0100709
00:40:36.159 --> 00:40:38.159
are facing problems like this.

cue0100710
00:40:38.159 --> 00:40:40.159
You are powerful

cue0100711
00:40:40.159 --> 00:40:42.159
but you cannot use your power

cue0100712
00:40:42.159 --> 00:40:44.159
against your enemy.

cue0100713
00:40:44.159 --> 00:40:46.159
You have to say

cue0100714
00:40:46.159 --> 00:40:48.159
only you God can help me.

cue0100715
00:40:48.159 --> 00:40:50.159
Yes.

cue0100716
00:40:50.159 --> 00:40:52.159
Yes.

cue0100717
00:40:56.159 --> 00:40:58.159
And also there are some

cue0100718
00:40:58.159 --> 00:41:00.159
songs that for one reason or another

cue0100719
00:41:00.159 --> 00:41:02.159
were not composed by David.

cue0100720
00:41:02.159 --> 00:41:04.159
Mizmor

cue0100721
00:41:08.159 --> 00:41:10.159
and so on.

cue0100722
00:41:10.159 --> 00:41:12.159
But the

cue0100723
00:41:12.159 --> 00:41:14.159
the type

cue0100724
00:41:14.159 --> 00:41:16.159
the song

cue0100725
00:41:16.159 --> 00:41:18.159
that is King David.

cue0100726
00:41:18.159 --> 00:41:20.159
And yes in other people

cue0100727
00:41:20.159 --> 00:41:22.159
for whatever reason because the Qoraḥ

cue0100728
00:41:22.159 --> 00:41:24.159
they were Levine.

cue0100729
00:41:24.159 --> 00:41:26.159
Yes we are also

cue0100730
00:41:26.159 --> 00:41:28.159
one of those Rabbin

cue0100731
00:41:28.159 --> 00:41:30.159
we have also Chopin, Shalom Mohamed

cue0100732
00:41:30.159 --> 00:41:32.159
yes but the

cue0100733
00:41:32.159 --> 00:41:34.159
bulk of the songs

cue0100734
00:41:34.159 --> 00:41:36.159
is King David.

cue0100735
00:41:36.159 --> 00:41:38.159
Yes.

cue0100736
00:41:40.159 --> 00:41:42.159
No.

cue0100737
00:41:42.159 --> 00:41:44.159
Obviously it was not

cue0100738
00:41:44.159 --> 00:41:46.159
written by

cue0100739
00:41:46.159 --> 00:41:48.159
David Amel.

cue0100740
00:41:48.159 --> 00:41:50.159
Yes.

cue0100741
00:41:50.159 --> 00:41:52.159
What?

cue0100742
00:41:52.159 --> 00:41:54.159
Oh.

cue0100743
00:41:54.159 --> 00:41:56.159
Very important.

cue0100744
00:41:56.159 --> 00:41:58.159
There is

cue0100745
00:41:58.159 --> 00:42:00.159
on occasions

cue0100746
00:42:00.159 --> 00:42:02.159
we have a prophecy

cue0100747
00:42:02.159 --> 00:42:04.159
but this prophecy is not

cue0100748
00:42:04.159 --> 00:42:06.159
written in the book of Tehillim

cue0100749
00:42:06.159 --> 00:42:08.159
but is written in the book of

cue0100750
00:42:08.159 --> 00:42:10.159
Shemuʾel. Yes.

cue0100751
00:42:10.159 --> 00:42:12.159
Because the book of Tehillim is part of

cue0100752
00:42:12.159 --> 00:42:14.159
this Tora

cue0100753
00:42:14.159 --> 00:42:16.159
I consider as the

cue0100754
00:42:16.159 --> 00:42:18.159
constitution of Jewish people.

cue0100755
00:42:18.159 --> 00:42:20.159
Then they have Neḇiʾim

cue0100756
00:42:20.159 --> 00:42:22.159
and they have Ketuḇim.

cue0100757
00:42:22.159 --> 00:42:24.159
The book of Tehillim is not

cue0100758
00:42:24.159 --> 00:42:26.159
in Neḇiʾim.

cue0100759
00:42:26.159 --> 00:42:28.159
It is in Ketuḇim.

cue0100760
00:42:28.159 --> 00:42:30.159
You see? So he may have had

cue0100761
00:42:30.159 --> 00:42:32.159
occasional prophecy

cue0100762
00:42:32.159 --> 00:42:34.159
but the book of Tehillim is

cue0100763
00:42:34.159 --> 00:42:36.159
not part of Neḇiʾim.

cue0100764
00:42:36.159 --> 00:42:38.159
And I

cue0100765
00:42:38.159 --> 00:42:40.159
personally

cue0100766
00:42:40.159 --> 00:42:42.159
I never discussed this with anybody

cue0100767
00:42:42.159 --> 00:42:44.159
I consider David Amel

cue0100768
00:42:44.159 --> 00:42:46.159
as the greatest philosophy in the history

cue0100769
00:42:46.159 --> 00:42:48.159
of humankind.

cue0100770
00:42:48.159 --> 00:42:50.159
Because the depth of

cue0100771
00:42:50.159 --> 00:42:52.159
the Psalms

cue0100772
00:42:52.159 --> 00:42:54.159
there are no parallels with the depth of the

cue0100773
00:42:54.159 --> 00:42:56.159
Psalms. I mean philosophy of life

cue0100774
00:42:56.159 --> 00:42:58.159
yes?

cue0100775
00:42:58.159 --> 00:43:00.159
Not stupid questions

cue0100776
00:43:00.159 --> 00:43:02.159
about metaphysics

cue0100777
00:43:02.159 --> 00:43:04.159
to be or not to be

cue0100778
00:43:04.159 --> 00:43:06.159
or nonsense things.

cue0100779
00:43:06.159 --> 00:43:08.159
Philosophy of life

cue0100780
00:43:08.159 --> 00:43:10.159
I think that David Amel was

cue0100781
00:43:10.159 --> 00:43:12.159
the greatest philosopher ever.

cue0100782
00:43:12.159 --> 00:43:14.159
Yes? And

cue0100783
00:43:14.159 --> 00:43:16.159
that's why our people

cue0100784
00:43:16.159 --> 00:43:18.159
Sephardim, ʾAshkenaz,

cue0100785
00:43:18.159 --> 00:43:20.159
all

cue0100786
00:43:20.159 --> 00:43:22.159
